WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.331
"Rex is coming!" Sid said.

2
00:00:14.332 --> 00:00:18.449
He looked around.

3
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:26.674
"Where will I hide?"

4
00:00:26.675 --> 00:00:33.178
Sid ran up a hill.

5
00:00:33.179 --> 00:00:36.089
He looked down the other side.

6
00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:45.107
He saw flowers.

7
00:00:45.108 --> 00:00:47.852
A breeze blew.

8
00:00:47.853 --> 00:00:51.485
Sid sniffed. "Mmm.

9
00:00:51.486 --> 00:00:55.196
The flowers smell sweet!"

10
00:00:55.197 --> 00:00:57.806
Rex ran through the forest.

11
00:00:57.807 --> 00:01:01.810
"Sid stinks at hide-and-seek," he thought.

12
00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:12.856
"I'll find him soon!"

13
00:01:12.857 --> 00:01:16.838
Rex looked all over.

14
00:01:16.839 --> 00:01:20.374
But he couldn't find Sid.

15
00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:24.085
He couldn't find Sara or Tor.

16
00:01:24.086 --> 00:01:26.700
Tor sat up in a tree.

17
00:01:26.701 --> 00:01:28.968
She watched Rex.

18
00:01:28.969 --> 00:01:32.416
Tor giggled softly.

19
00:01:32.417 --> 00:01:38.639
"Rex won't find me here!" she thought.

20
00:01:38.640 --> 00:01:46.855
Sara sat behind a big rock.

21
00:01:46.856 --> 00:01:49.010
Rex was close.

22
00:01:49.011 --> 00:01:51.537
"Oh no," Sara thought.

23
00:01:51.538 --> 00:01:55.618
"I need a new hiding spot!"

24
00:01:55.619 --> 00:02:00.447
Sid munched flowers.

25
00:02:00.448 --> 00:02:02.813
"Yum!" he said.

26
00:02:02.814 --> 00:02:06.872
"I love flowers!"

27
00:02:06.873 --> 00:02:07.766
Snap!

28
00:02:07.767 --> 00:02:10.076
A branch broke nearby.

29
00:02:10.077 --> 00:02:15.572
Sid stopped eating.

30
00:02:15.573 --> 00:02:20.487
"Uh-oh," he said.

31
00:02:20.488 --> 00:02:24.585
"Rex is coming!"

